<script setup lang="ts">const props=defineProps<{modelValue:'school'|'major'|'city'}>();const emit=defineEmits<{(e:'update:modelValue',v:'school'|'major'|'city'):void}>();const opts=[['school','院校优先'],['major','专业优先'],['city','城市优先']] as const</script><template><div class="strategy-tabs"><button v-for="[v,l] in opts" :key="v" :class="{selected:props.modelValue===v}" @click="emit('update:modelValue',v)">{{l}}</button></div></template>
